sequenceDiagram
    participant U as Utilisateur
    participant R as React
    participant AI as routes/ai.ts
    participant S as Services externes
    participant PK as services/claude/pack.ts
    participant SC as services/scoring.ts
    participant P as Prisma + PostgreSQL

    U->>R: clique « Générer »
    R->>AI: POST /api/ai/generate
    AI->>S: Promise.allSettled [vols, events, hôtels, météo, photo]
    AI->>S: foursquareSearch() → yelpSearch() (fallback)
    S-->>AI: données réelles (best-effort, timeout 30s)
    AI->>PK: assemblePack(données)
    Note over PK: callAI Claude→Gemini→OpenRouter→Mocks
    Note over PK: parsePackResponse + mapFlights + mapActivities
    PK-->>AI: pack JSON structuré
    AI->>SC: scorepack(pack, mode)
    SC-->>AI: score 0–1 déterministe
    AI->>P: prisma.trip.create + pack (transaction, si connecté)
    P-->>AI: trip_id, pack_id
    AI-->>R: pack + score + isMock
    R-->>U: PackResults (bandeau si isMock)
